    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>BONUS early access</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Early Access Offer \u2013 Support development by purchasing the Early Access version and get exclusive bonuses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early access sale of our game is available! By purchasing this early version, you are directly contributing to its development and helping Instinc'Team Studio refine the gaming experience. As thanks for your support, you will receive exclusive in-game bonuses, reserved only for players who have purchased this edition. These unique rewards will only be available on this occasion and will add a special touch to your adventure as a supermarket manager. Join us today to experience this adventure with an exclusive advantage!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Your Own Supermarket \u2013 A Complete and Immersive Management Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a unique management game where you take the reins of a modern supermarket! With Instinc'Team Studio, experience the ultimate in store management in a world with breathtaking detail. Built with Unreal Engine 5.4, the most powerful game engine of the moment, this game offers meticulous, ultra-realistic graphics with exceptional textures and objects. Every detail is designed to fully immerse you in your role as manager.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Management, Strategy, and Customization at Your Fingertips</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a true manager and control every aspect of your supermarket. Your creativity is the key: design and personalize every area to your liking\u2014storage rooms, walls, floors, exteriors, warehouses, and even the aisles. The customization options don\u2019t stop there: adapt the store to each season and event with a variety of inspiring themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the products you want to sell: from fresh fruits and vegetables to decor items, phones, and toys. Decide on your brands and suppliers for each category: favor higher-priced brand-name items to attract specific customers or opt for more affordable products to appeal to a wider audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique and Innovative Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supplier System: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collaborate with multiple suppliers</strong> offering the same products, and define your pricing strategy. Some brands may be pricier, but will attract customers willing to pay for quality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Payment System</strong> \u2013 Discover T-AirPay, an exclusive in-game payment method, adding a modern touch to your management experience and letting you focus on what matters most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Lottery</strong>: Receive random products every day to enrich your supermarket and surprise your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible Rewards</strong>: Unlock unique trophies and figurines to decorate your office or store space.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multilingual and Interactive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reach a global audience, the game is available in multiple languages: French, English, and soon Japanese, Chinese, and many more, with immersive voice acting currently available in French.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Season Pass and Frequent Updates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To enhance the gaming experience, we offer a Season Pass (available in upcoming updates) with exclusive gifts and bonuses. Regular updates will add new content and features, with a public roadmap to keep you informed of upcoming developments in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unexpected Visits\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark of your supermarket, keep an eye out. Sometimes, unexpected guests may show up\u2026 Is there really a superhero around, or is it just your imagination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Image Preview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343790/extras/965178715932fc5d6a48f5673822d538.avif?t=1737393456\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343790/extras/701847ffbcc5c542fd2d53f0a3d823d4.avif?t=1737393456\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343790/extras/6e4ebc2e545df8c79a9e9f9cc2faf807.avif?t=1737393456\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343790/extras/cd43b54f7532e1166ee4076b9ef7b680.avif?t=1737393456\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343790/extras/340c72fbfdc7a101d9f07da21deb832d.avif?t=1737393456\" data-has-big width=800 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343790/extras/52c2ecded0009a29aae58d0cfe59921a.avif?t=1737393456\" data-has-big width=800 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343790/extras/ce1fd53a22567e5443b5dc9949212e97.avif?t=1737393456\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343790/extras/ce35e109ccb1c723cc8a50e946913e65.avif?t=1737393456\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343790/extras/3173fc4249c621f2b7ee983a0cda2aeb.avif?t=1737393456\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to become an accomplished manager and experience an exciting, limitless management adventure!</p>",
